      170.53,
      550.05,
      196.0
    ],
    "text": "3. These Orders, under Section 2 and 5 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007, shall be effective commencing from October 10, 2025 to March 31, 2026 subject to provisions of Sub Section (3) of Section 2 of the said Act.",
